{# Additive MRI projection. Same release_forecast.json fetch, no second source/clock/collector. #}
<style>
#rr-visual-history{margin:16px 0 20px;color:var(--text);font-size:13px}
#rr-visual-history *{box-sizing:border-box}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-shell{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-card,12px);background:var(--panel2);overflow:hidden}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-top{padding:16px 18px 12px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
#rr-visual-history h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 4px}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-intro{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;max-width:550px}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-controls{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-controls label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted)}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-controls select{min-height:44px;min-width:86px;padding:8px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);font:inherit;font-size:12px;max-width:100%}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-controls select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--link);outline-offset:2px}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-body{padding:10px 18px 15px}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-headline{display:flex;gap:10px 20px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-value{font-size:clamp(28px,4.8vw,46px);letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:750}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-delta{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-interpretation{font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;min-height:19px;margin:8px 0}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-basis-warning{display:block;margin-top:5px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:750}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-state{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0;min-height:14px}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-chart-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);margin:14px 0 0}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-chart{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;min-height:160px;max-height:285px;overflow:visible}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-chart text{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-meta{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;margin:6px 0 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1px;background:var(--line);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-fact{background:var(--panel);padding:12px 13px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;min-width:0}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-fact-name{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.35}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-fact-value{font-size:18px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.35;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;word-break:break-word}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-fact-note{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-foot{padding:10px 16px 12px;background:var(--panel)}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-foot .mx-disc{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-foot summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:650;font-size:12px;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-foot summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--link);outline-offset:2px}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-foot .mx-disc-body{padding:0 12px 12px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted)}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-foot table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-foot th,#rr-visual-history .rrh-foot td{padding:5px 9px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
#rr-visual-history .rrh-foot a{color:var(--link)}
@media(max-width:850px){#rr-visual-history .rrh-facts{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}}
@media(max-width:600px){
  #rr-visual-history .rrh-top{padding:12px}
  #rr-visual-history .rrh-body{padding:10px 12px}
  #rr-visual-history .rrh-controls{width:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:6px}
  #rr-visual-history .rrh-controls select{min-width:0;width:100%;padding:8px 4px;font-size:11px}
  #rr-visual-history .rrh-facts{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
  #rr-visual-history .rrh-fact{padding:11px 9px}
  #rr-visual-history .rrh-fact-value{font-size:16px}
  #rr-visual-history .rrh-chart{min-height:135px}
}
</style>
<section id="rr-visual-history" aria-labelledby="rrh-title">
  <div class="rrh-shell">
    <div class="rrh-top">
      <div>
        <h3 id="rrh-title"><span class="l-en">Release history at a glance</span><span class="l-zh">数据发布历史速览</span></h3>
        <p class="rrh-intro"><span class="l-en">Verified index trends, first prints and expectations. BLS annual rates (NSA) and monthly rates (SA) are different.</span><span class="l-zh">历史指数、官方首次值及市场预期分开呈现；BLS 同比采用未季调指数，环比采用季调指数。</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="rrh-controls">
        <label><span class="l-en">Measure</span><span class="l-zh">指标</span>
          <select data-rrh-target aria-label="Inflation measure">
            <option value="ppi_finaldemand">PPI final demand</option><option value="cpi_headline">CPI</option>
            <option value="cpi_core">Core CPI</option><option value="pce_headline">PCE</option>
            <option value="pce_core">Core PCE</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label><span class="l-en">Basis</span><span class="l-zh">比较口径</span>
          <select data-rrh-basis aria-label="History comparison basis">
            <option value="yoy">YoY</option><option value="mom">MoM</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label><span class="l-en">Window</span><span class="l-zh">时间窗口</span>
          <select data-rrh-window aria-label="History window">
            <option value="12">1 year</option><option value="36" selected>3 years</option><option value="60">5 years</option>
          </select>
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rrh-body">
      <div class="rrh-headline"><strong data-rrh-value class="rrh-value">—</strong>
        <span data-rrh-delta class="rrh-delta"><span class="l-en">Monthly change unavailable.</span><span class="l-zh">月度变化暂不可用。</span></span>
      </div>
      <p data-rrh-interpretation class="rrh-interpretation"><span class="l-en">Awaiting a qualified history snapshot.</span><span class="l-zh">等待来源合格的历史数据快照。</span></p>
      <p data-rrh-state class="rrh-state" role="status" aria-live="polite"><span class="l-en">Loading historical context.</span><span class="l-zh">加载历史背景中。</span></p>
      <h4 data-rrh-chart-title id="rrh-chart-title" class="rrh-chart-title"><span class="l-en">Historical inflation</span><span class="l-zh">历史通胀</span></h4>
      <svg data-rrh-chart class="rrh-chart" viewBox="0 0 720 260" role="img" aria-labelledby="rrh-chart-title" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"></svg>
      <p data-rrh-meta class="rrh-meta"><span class="l-en">Source details pending.</span><span class="l-zh">等待来源详情。</span></p>
    </div>
    <div data-rrh-facts class="rrh-facts" aria-label="Release context">
      <div class="rrh-fact"><span class="l-en">Expectations and official prints appear here only when source-qualified.</span><span class="l-zh">仅在来源核验合格后显示预期和官方首次公布值。</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="rrh-foot">
      <details class="mx-disc">
        <summary><span class="l-en">Data, revisions and last 12 readings</span><span class="l-zh">数据口径、修订与最近 12 期</span></summary>
        <div class="mx-disc-body">
          <p><span class="l-en">The chart derives trends from one ALFRED collection-time snapshot of revised indices. For BLS CPI/PPI, the reported 12-month rate uses NOT seasonally adjusted (NSA) indices, while the monthly print uses seasonally adjusted (SA) indices. When an optional NSA index is missing, the chart labels its SA YoY value as a proxy, not the official headline. PCE uses BEA seasonally adjusted indices for both horizons. Missing reference months remain missing (including October 2025 CPI). This is not a release-day first-print archive. Verified official first-print MoM receipts and qualified pre-release economist consensus are shown separately; model estimates are never relabelled as Street consensus.</span>
            <span class="l-zh">图表基于同一采集时点的 ALFRED 修订后指数。BLS 的 CPI/PPI 官方同比采用未季调 (NSA) 指数，环比采用季调 (SA) 指数；若未季调指数缺失，则将季调同比明确标注为替代值而非官方同比。BEA 的 PCE 两种口径均采用季调指数；缺失月份（含 2025 年 10 月 CPI）不插值。官方首次环比值与发布前经济学家共识独立验证，模型预测不会冒充市场共识。</span></p>
          <p><span class="l-en">A rising inflation series is descriptive, not a prediction of yields or stock performance. Missing months remain gaps; stale collections are labelled.</span>
            <span class="l-zh">通胀上行仅为描述，不代表利率或股价预测。缺失月份保留空缺，过期采集明确标识。</span></p>
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th><span class="l-en">Reference month</span><span class="l-zh">统计月份</span></th>
              <th><span class="l-en">Revised reading</span><span class="l-zh">修订后数值</span></th></tr></thead>
            <tbody data-rrh-table></tbody>
          </table>
          <p><a data-rrh-source href="https://fred.stlouisfed.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span class="l-en">FRED/ALFRED series source</span><span class="l-zh">FRED/ALFRED 数据来源</span></a>
          </p>
          <p><span class="l-en">Display-only research context. No forecast-validation, risk gate, position sizing or trading permission.</span>
            <span class="l-zh">仅供研究展示，不授权预测验证、风控门槛、仓位配置或交易。</span></p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script>
{% include "release_visual_history.js" %}
</script>
